{"code":"ar","name":"Arabic","native":"العربية","phase":1,"medium":"en","file_level":"B1","level":{"title":"Intermediate: كان, dual, commands, opinions","goals":["Tell stories with كان and time words","Command politely and negate every tense","Argue opinions and talk weather and plans"],"units":[{"id":"B1-U1","title":"Past stories and dual","lessons":[{"id":"B1-U1-L1","title":"كان: was and were","learn":"كان = was/were! كان كبيرا (he was big), كانت جميلة (she was beautiful). Stories: كان يدرس = he WAS studying (كان + present = was doing!). Unlock the storytelling past!","vocab":[{"t":"كان","r":"kāna","en":"he was","pos":"verb"},{"t":"كانت","r":"kānat","en":"she was","pos":"verb"},{"t":"عندما","r":"ʿindamā","en":"when","pos":"conjunction"},{"t":"بينما","r":"baynamā","en":"while","pos":"conjunction"},{"t":"فجأة","r":"fajʾatan","en":"suddenly","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"مرة","r":"marra","en":"once / a time","pos":"noun"},{"t":"قصة","r":"qiṣṣa","en":"story","pos":"noun"},{"t":"حفلة","r":"ḥafla","en":"party","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"كان + word / كان + present","explain":"كان مدرسا (he was a teacher), كانت جميلة (she was beautiful). كان يدرس = he was studying. كنتُ (I was), كنتَ (you-m were), كنتِ (you-f were)!","pattern":"كان/كانت + noun/adj · كان + present","examples":[{"t":"كان الجو جميلا.","r":"kāna al-jaww jamīlan.","en":"The weather was beautiful."},{"t":"كنتُ أدرس.","r":"kuntu adrus.","en":"I was studying."},{"t":"كانت في الحفلة.","r":"kānat fī al-ḥafla.","en":"She was at the party."}],"mistakes":["Saying أنا كان — I-was is كنتُ!","Saying كانت جميلةٌ with ة-damma — كان's خبر takes -اً/-ةً!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"ليلى","t":"أين كنت أمس؟","r":"ayna kunta ams?","en":"Where were you yesterday? (to m)"},{"sp":"عمر","t":"كنتُ في الحفلة. كانت جميلة!","r":"kuntu fī al-ḥafla. kānat jamīla!","en":"I was at the party. It was beautiful!"},{"sp":"ليلى","t":"وأنا كنتُ أدرس.","r":"wa anā kuntu adrus.","en":"And I was studying."},{"sp":"عمر","t":"مسكينة!","r":"miskīna!","en":"Poor you! (to f)"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I was studying","answer":"كنتُ أدرس"},{"type":"fill","q":"___ في الحفلة. (She was)","answer":"كانت"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Where were you yesterday?' (to m) is…","options":["أين أنت أمس؟","أين كنت أمس؟","أين تكون أمس؟","أين ستكون أمس؟"],"answer":"أين كنت أمس؟"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: أدرس / كنتُ","answer":"كنتُ أدرس"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: كنتُ في الحفلة.","answer":"كنتُ في الحفلة."}],"quiz":[{"q":"كنتُ means…","options":["you were","I was","he was","we were"],"answer":1,"why":"-تُ = I."},{"q":"كان يدرس means…","options":["he studies","he studied","he was studying","he will study"],"answer":2,"why":"كان + present = was doing."},{"q":"كانت is for…","options":["he","she","they","I"],"answer":1,"why":"-تْ = she."},{"q":"عندما means…","options":["while","when","suddenly","then"],"answer":1,"why":"عندما = when."},{"q":"فجأة means…","options":["slowly","suddenly","always","never"],"answer":1,"why":"فجأة = suddenly."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"كان worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Arabic.","items":["he was","she was","story"],"key":["كان","كانت","قصة"]},{"instruction":"كان forms.","items":["I was studying","She was at the party","The weather was beautiful"],"key":["كنتُ أدرس","كانت في الحفلة","كان الجو جميلا"]},{"instruction":"Ask yesterday.","items":["Where were you yesterday? (m)","I was at the party"],"key":["أين كنت أمس؟","كنتُ في الحفلة"]}]}},{"id":"B1-U1-L2","title":"Dual: كتابان","learn":"Arabic has a DUAL — a special TWO form! كتابان (two books), يومان (two days), مدرستان (two schools-f). Just add -ان! 1–2 come AFTER nouns: كتاب واحد, يومان اثنان!","vocab":[{"t":"اثنان","r":"ithnān","en":"two","pos":"number"},{"t":"كتابان","r":"kitābān","en":"two books","pos":"noun"},{"t":"يومان","r":"yawmān","en":"two days","pos":"noun"},{"t":"مرتان","r":"marratān","en":"twice","pos":"noun"},{"t":"أول","r":"awwal","en":"first","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"ثان","r":"thān","en":"second","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"بعد","r":"baʿda","en":"after","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"قبل","r":"qabla","en":"before","pos":"adverb"}],"grammar":{"title":"Dual with -ان","explain":"كتاب→كتابان, يوم→يومان, مدرسة→مدرستان. Verbs too: يدرسان (they-two study)! Dual is everywhere — two eyes (عينان), two hands (يدان)!","pattern":"noun + ان = two","examples":[{"t":"عندي كتابان.","r":"ʿindī kitābān.","en":"I have two books."},{"t":"بعد يومين.","r":"baʿda yawmayn.","en":"After two days."},{"t":"هما يدرسان.","r":"humā yadrusān.","en":"They (two) study."}],"mistakes":["Saying اثنين كتاب — duals: كتابان!","Forgetting feminine ة→ت: مدرستان, not مدرسةان!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"عمر","t":"كم كتابا عندك؟","r":"kam kitāban ʿindak?","en":"How many books do you have? (to m)"},{"sp":"ليلى","t":"عندي كتابان.","r":"ʿindī kitābān.","en":"I have two books."},{"sp":"عمر","t":"وأنا عندي ثلاثة!","r":"wa anā ʿindī thalātha!","en":"And I have three!"},{"sp":"ليلى","t":"ما شاء الله!","r":"mā shāʾa allāh!","en":"Wonderful! (God has willed it)"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I have two books","answer":"عندي كتابان"},{"type":"fill","q":"بعد ___ (two days)","answer":"يومين"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Two schools' is…","options":["مدرسةان","مدرستان","مدرستين اثنين","مدارس اثنان"],"answer":"مدرستان"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: كتابان / عندي","answer":"عندي كتابان"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: عندي كتابان.","answer":"عندي كتابان."}],"quiz":[{"q":"كتابان means…","options":["a book","two books","books","my book"],"answer":1,"why":"-ان = dual two."},{"q":"Feminine dual of مدرسة is…","options":["مدرسةان","مدرستان","مدرسات","مدرست"],"answer":1,"why":"ة→ت + ان."},{"q":"هما يدرسان means…","options":["he studies","they (two) study","we study","I study"],"answer":1,"why":"-ان verb = dual they."},{"q":"يدان means…","options":["two eyes","two hands","two days","two books"],"answer":1,"why":"يد→يدان — body duals!"},{"q":"مرتان means…","options":["once","twice","often","never"],"answer":1,"why":"مرة→مرتان."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Dual worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Arabic.","items":["two","first","twice"],"key":["اثنان","أول","مرتان"]},{"instruction":"Make duals.","items":["two books","two days","two schools"],"key":["كتابان","يومان","مدرستان"]},{"instruction":"Count.","items":["I have two books","And I have three!"],"key":["عندي كتابان","وأنا عندي ثلاثة"]}]}}]},{"id":"B1-U2","title":"Commands and negation","lessons":[{"id":"B1-U2-L1","title":"Imperative: ادرس!","learn":"Give orders! ادرس! (study! -m), ادرسي! (study! -f), اجلس! (sit!), تعال! (come!), اذهب! (go!). Soften with من فضلك: اجلس من فضلك = Please sit. Command + please = polite power!","vocab":[{"t":"اجلس","r":"ijlis","en":"sit! (m)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"قف","r":"qif","en":"stand! (m)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"تعال","r":"taʿāl","en":"come! (m)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"اذهب","r":"idhhab","en":"go! (m)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"افتح","r":"iftaḥ","en":"open! (m)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"اغلق","r":"ighliq","en":"close! (m)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"اسمع","r":"ismaʿ","en":"listen! (m)","pos":"verb"},{"t":"انظر","r":"unẓur","en":"look! (m)","pos":"verb"}],"grammar":{"title":"Imperative: ادرس/ادرسي","explain":"To men: ادرس، اجلس، تعال. To women add -ي: ادرسي، اجلسي، تعالي. To groups: ادرسوا! Negate with لا: لا تذهب! = Don't go!","pattern":"ادرسي (f) · ادرسوا (pl) · لا + تـ- (don't)","examples":[{"t":"اجلس من فضلك!","r":"ijlis min faḍlik!","en":"Please sit! (m)"},{"t":"تعالي هنا!","r":"taʿālī hunā!","en":"Come here! (f)"},{"t":"لا تذهب!","r":"lā tadhhab!","en":"Don't go!"}],"mistakes":["Saying ادرس to a woman — women get ادرسي!","Saying ما تذهب for don't — commands negate with لا!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"عمر","t":"تعال هنا!","r":"taʿāl hunā!","en":"Come here! (to m)"},{"sp":"ليلى","t":"أنا مشغولة! اذهب هناك!","r":"anā mashghūla! idhhab hunāk!","en":"I'm busy (f)! Go there!"},{"sp":"عمر","t":"حسنا! اجلسي من فضلك!","r":"ḥasanan! ijlisī min faḍlik!","en":"Okay! Please sit! (to f)"},{"sp":"ليلى","t":"شكرا!","r":"shukran!","en":"Thanks!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say (to m): Please sit!","answer":"اجلس من فضلك!"},{"type":"fill","q":"___ هنا! (Come, to f)","answer":"تعالي"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Don't go!' is…","options":["ما تذهب","لا تذهب","لم تذهب","لن تذهب"],"answer":"لا تذهب"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: فضلك / من / اجلس","answer":"اجلس من فضلك"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: تعال هنا!","answer":"تعال هنا!"}],"quiz":[{"q":"ادرسي is for…","options":["men","women","groups","children"],"answer":1,"why":"-ي = feminine command."},{"q":"ادررسوا is for…","options":["one man","one woman","groups","nobody"],"answer":2,"why":"-وا = plural command."},{"q":"لا تذهب means…","options":["he goes","don't go","he went","he will go"],"answer":1,"why":"لا + present = don't!"},{"q":"افتح means…","options":["close!","open!","sit!","go!"],"answer":1,"why":"افتح = open! (m)"},{"q":"من فضلك makes commands…","options":["stronger","polite","plural","past"],"answer":1,"why":"Please softens orders."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Imperative worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Arabic.","items":["sit! (m)","come! (m)","listen! (m)"],"key":["اجلس","تعال","اسمع"]},{"instruction":"Command people.","items":["Please sit! (m)","Come here! (f)","Don't go!"],"key":["اجلس من فضلك","تعالي هنا","لا تذهب"]},{"instruction":"Boss around.","items":["Go there! (m)","Thanks!"],"key":["اذهب هناك","شكرا"]}]}},{"id":"B1-U2-L2","title":"Negation: لا، ما، لم، لن","learn":"Four NEVERS! لا + present (لا أدرس = I don't study), ما + past (ما درستُ = I didn't study), لم + bare present (لم أدرس = I didn't study), لن + present (لن أدرس = I won't study). Pick by TENSE!","vocab":[{"t":"لا","r":"lā","en":"no / don't (present)","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"ما","r":"mā","en":"not (past)","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"لم","r":"lam","en":"didn't (past)","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"لن","r":"lan","en":"won't (future)","pos":"phrase"},{"t":"أبدا","r":"abadan","en":"never","pos":"adverb"},{"t":"أي","r":"ayy","en":"any","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"شيء","r":"shayʾ","en":"thing","pos":"noun"},{"t":"أحد","r":"aḥad","en":"anyone","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"لا/لم/لن/ما by tense","explain":"لا أدرس (I don't study), لم أدرس / ما درستُ (I didn't study), لن أدرس (I won't study). لم eats endings: لم يدرسْ (he didn't study)!","pattern":"لا+present · لم+bare · لن+future · ما+past","examples":[{"t":"لا أدرس اليوم.","r":"lā adrus al-yawm.","en":"I don't study today."},{"t":"لم أدرس أمس.","r":"lam adrus ams.","en":"I didn't study yesterday."},{"t":"لن أدرس غدا.","r":"lan adrus ghadan.","en":"I won't study tomorrow."}],"mistakes":["Saying لا درستُ — past needs ما or لم!","Saying لن درستُ — لن loves PRESENT verbs!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"ليلى","t":"هل تدرس اليوم؟","r":"hal tadrus al-yawm?","en":"Do you study today? (to m)"},{"sp":"عمر","t":"لا، لا أدرس اليوم.","r":"lā, lā adrus al-yawm.","en":"No, I don't study today."},{"sp":"ليلى","t":"وهل درست أمس؟","r":"wa hal darasta ams?","en":"And did you study yesterday?"},{"sp":"عمر","t":"لا، لم أدرس.","r":"lā, lam adrus.","en":"No, I didn't study."}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I don't study today","answer":"لا أدرس اليوم"},{"type":"fill","q":"لم ___ أمس. (I study)","answer":"أدرس"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I won't study tomorrow' is…","options":["ما أدرس غدا","لن أدرس غدا","لا درست غدا","لم أدرس غدا"],"answer":"لن أدرس غدا"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: أدرس / اليوم / لا","answer":"لا أدرس اليوم"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: لا، لم أدرس.","answer":"لا، لم أدرس."}],"quiz":[{"q":"لا أدرس means…","options":["I didn't study","I don't study","I won't study","study!"],"answer":1,"why":"لا + present."},{"q":"لم أدرس means…","options":["I don't study","I didn't study","I won't study","study!"],"answer":1,"why":"لم + bare present."},{"q":"لن أدرس means…","options":["I don't study","I didn't study","I won't study","study!"],"answer":2,"why":"لن + present."},{"q":"ما درستُ means…","options":["I don't study","I didn't study","I won't study","study!"],"answer":1,"why":"ما + past."},{"q":"لم changes verbs by…","options":["adding ة","eating endings","adding س","nothing"],"answer":1,"why":"لم يدرسْ — bare form!"}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Negation worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Arabic.","items":["don't (present)","didn't (past)","won't (future)"],"key":["لا","لم / ما","لن"]},{"instruction":"Negate أدرس.","items":["I don't study today","I didn't study yesterday","I won't study tomorrow"],"key":["لا أدرس اليوم","لم أدرس أمس","لن أدرس غدا"]},{"instruction":"Say no.","items":["No, I don't study today","No, I didn't study"],"key":["لا، لا أدرس اليوم","لا، لم أدرس"]}]}}]},{"id":"B1-U3","title":"Opinions and weather","lessons":[{"id":"B1-U3-L1","title":"Opinions and أفضل","learn":"Argue in Arabic! أعتقد أن… (I think that…), أفضل (better), أسوأ (worse), أكبر (bigger). أفعل pattern = comparatives! الأفضل = THE best. معك حق! = You're right!","vocab":[{"t":"أعتقد","r":"aʿtaqid","en":"I think / believe","pos":"verb"},{"t":"أظن","r":"aẓunn","en":"I suppose","pos":"verb"},{"t":"أفضل","r":"afḍal","en":"better / best","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"أسوأ","r":"aswaʾ","en":"worse","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"أكبر","r":"akbar","en":"bigger","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"أصغر","r":"aṣghar","en":"smaller","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"رأي","r":"raʾy","en":"opinion","pos":"noun"},{"t":"حق","r":"ḥaqq","en":"right / truth","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"أعتقد أن + أفعل comparatives","explain":"أعتقد أن المترو أفضل (I think the metro is better). من = than: أكبر من بيتي (bigger than my house). الأفضل = the best!","pattern":"أعتقد أن… + أفعل + من","examples":[{"t":"أعتقد أن هذا أفضل.","r":"aʿtaqid anna hādhā afḍal.","en":"I think this is better."},{"t":"القاهرة أكبر من بيتي.","r":"al-qāhira akbar min baytī.","en":"Cairo is bigger than my house."},{"t":"معك حق!","r":"maʿaka ḥaqq!","en":"You're right! (to m)"}],"mistakes":["Saying أكثر أفضل — أفضل ALREADY means better!","Forgetting من: bigger THAN = أكبر من!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"ليلى","t":"أعتقد أن المترو أفضل.","r":"aʿtaqid anna al-mitrū afḍal.","en":"I think the metro is better."},{"sp":"عمر","t":"وأنا أظن أن السيارة أسرع.","r":"wa anā aẓunn anna as-sayyāra asraʿ.","en":"And I suppose the car is faster."},{"sp":"ليلى","t":"لكن المترو أرخص!","r":"lākinna al-mitrū arkhaṣ!","en":"But the metro is cheaper!"},{"sp":"عمر","t":"معك حق!","r":"maʿaki ḥaqq!","en":"You're right! (to f)"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I think this is better","answer":"أعتقد أن هذا أفضل"},{"type":"fill","q":"معك ___! (right)","answer":"حق"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Cairo is bigger than my house' is…","options":["القاهرة كبير بيتي","القاهرة أكبر من بيتي","القاهرة الكبير من بيتي","القاهرة أكبر بيتي"],"answer":"القاهرة أكبر من بيتي"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: أفضل / هذا / أن / أعتقد","answer":"أعتقد أن هذا أفضل"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: أعتقد أن المترو أفضل.","answer":"أعتقد أن المترو أفضل."}],"quiz":[{"q":"أعتقد أن means…","options":["I know that","I think that","I see that","I want that"],"answer":1,"why":"أعتقد أن = I think that."},{"q":"أسوأ means…","options":["better","worse","bigger","smaller"],"answer":1,"why":"أسوأ = worse."},{"q":"أكبر من means…","options":["big house","bigger than","very big","big and tall"],"answer":1,"why":"أفعل + من = than."},{"q":"الأفضل means…","options":["good","the best","better","a good one"],"answer":1,"why":"ال + أفعل = superlative."},{"q":"معك حق means…","options":["you're wrong","you're right","you're late","you're lost"],"answer":1,"why":"معك حق = with-you truth!"}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Opinions worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Arabic.","items":["I think","better","opinion"],"key":["أعتقد","أفضل","رأي"]},{"instruction":"Compare.","items":["I think this is better","Cairo is bigger than my house","You're right! (m)"],"key":["أعتقد أن هذا أفضل","القاهرة أكبر من بيتي","معك حق!"]},{"instruction":"Debate.","items":["I think the metro is better","But the metro is cheaper!"],"key":["أعتقد أن المترو أفضل","لكن المترو أرخص!"]}]}},{"id":"B1-U3-L2","title":"Weather and plans","learn":"Arabic weather! الجو بارد (it's cold), الجو حار (it's hot), تمطر (it's raining), تثلج (it's snowing). الجو = the air — weather lives in الجو! Plus future plans with سـ!","vocab":[{"t":"طقس","r":"ṭaqs","en":"weather","pos":"noun"},{"t":"شمس","r":"shams","en":"sun","pos":"noun"},{"t":"مطر","r":"maṭar","en":"rain","pos":"noun"},{"t":"ثلج","r":"thalj","en":"snow","pos":"noun"},{"t":"بارد","r":"bārid","en":"cold","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"حار","r":"ḥārr","en":"hot","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"دافئ","r":"dāfiʾ","en":"warm","pos":"adjective"},{"t":"رياح","r":"riyāḥ","en":"wind","pos":"noun"}],"grammar":{"title":"الجو + adjective","explain":"الجو بارد (it's cold), الجو جميل (it's beautiful). Verbs: تمطر (it rains), تثلج (it snows). Future: سيكون الجو دافئا (it will be warm)!","pattern":"الجو + adj · تمطر/تثلج","examples":[{"t":"اليوم الجو بارد.","r":"al-yawm al-jaww bārid.","en":"Today it's cold."},{"t":"إنها تمطر.","r":"innahā tumṭir.","en":"It's raining."},{"t":"غدا سيكون دافئا.","r":"ghadan sayakūn dāfiʾan.","en":"Tomorrow it will be warm."}],"mistakes":["Saying هو بارد for weather — weather needs الجو!","Saying في مطر — raining = تمطر!"]},"dialogue":[{"sp":"عمر","t":"كيف الطقس اليوم؟","r":"kayfa aṭ-ṭaqs al-yawm?","en":"How is the weather today?"},{"sp":"ليلى","t":"الجو بارد! إنها تمطر.","r":"al-jaww bārid! innahā tumṭir.","en":"It's cold! It's raining."},{"sp":"عمر","t":"وغدا سيكون دافئا؟","r":"wa ghadan sayakūn dāfiʾan?","en":"And will it be warm tomorrow?"},{"sp":"ليلى","t":"نعم! لنخرج!","r":"naʿam! li-nakhruj!","en":"Yes! Let's go out!"}],"practice":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: It's cold! It's raining","answer":"الجو بارد! إنها تمطر"},{"type":"fill","q":"اليوم الجو ___. (cold)","answer":"بارد"},{"type":"choose","q":"'How is the weather today?' is…","options":["ما الطقس اليوم؟","كيف الطقس اليوم؟","أين الطقس اليوم؟","متى الطقس اليوم؟"],"answer":"كيف الطقس اليوم؟"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: بارد / الجو","answer":"الجو بارد"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: الجو بارد! إنها تمطر.","answer":"الجو بارد! إنها تمطر."}],"quiz":[{"q":"تمطر means…","options":["it snows","it rains","it winds","it shines"],"answer":1,"why":"تمطر = it's raining."},{"q":"الجو بارد means…","options":["it's hot","it's cold","it's warm","it's windy"],"answer":1,"why":"بارد = cold."},{"q":"سيكون دافئا means…","options":["is warm","was warm","will be warm","never warm"],"answer":2,"why":"سيكون = will be."},{"q":"Weather subject is…","options":["هو","الجو","هي","هم"],"answer":1,"why":"الجو = the air/weather."},{"q":"ثلج means…","options":["rain","snow","wind","sun"],"answer":1,"why":"ثلج = snow."}],"flashcards":"auto:vocab","worksheet":{"title":"Weather worksheet","tasks":[{"instruction":"Translate to Arabic.","items":["weather","snow","cold"],"key":["طقس","ثلج","بارد"]},{"instruction":"Report weather.","items":["It's raining","Today it's cold","Tomorrow it will be warm"],"key":["إنها تمطر","اليوم الجو بارد","غدا سيكون دافئا"]},{"instruction":"Ask and plan.","items":["How is the weather today?","Let's go out!"],"key":["كيف الطقس اليوم؟","لنخرج!"]}]}}]}],"test":{"title":"B1 final test","items":[{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I was studying","answer":"كنتُ أدرس"},{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I have two books","answer":"عندي كتابان"},{"type":"choose","q":"'Don't go!'","options":["ما تذهب","لا تذهب","لم تذهب","لن تذهب"],"answer":"لا تذهب"},{"type":"translate_t","q":"الجو بارد! إنها تمطر.","answer":"It's cold! It's raining."},{"type":"fill","q":"___ في الحفلة. (She was)","answer":"كانت"},{"type":"choose","q":"'I didn't study yesterday'","options":["لا أدرس أمس","لم أدرس أمس","لن أدرس أمس","ما أدرس أمس"],"answer":"لم أدرس أمس"},{"type":"reorder","q":"Order: أدرس / كنتُ","answer":"كنتُ أدرس"},{"type":"speak","q":"Say aloud: أعتقد أن المترو أفضل.","answer":"أعتقد أن المترو أفضل."},{"type":"fill","q":"معك ___! (right)","answer":"حق"},{"type":"translate_en","q":"Say: I think this is better","answer":"أعتقد أن هذا أفضل"}]}}}